    {
      "id": "spring-p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "1964 年春天，"
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "laura-vanderboom"
            },
            "label": "Laura"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 的第一段记忆从一间安静的 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "location",
              "id": "lauras-room"
            },
            "label": "房间"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 开始。时钟、厨房和望向花园的窗户让这里看起来像普通住所，但这种平静很快显得不可靠。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "In spring 1964, "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "laura-vanderboom"
            },
            "label": "Laura"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " begins her first memory inside a quiet "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "location",
              "id": "lauras-room"
            },
            "label": "room"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". A clock, kitchen, and garden window make it feel domestic, but the calm quickly becomes unreliable."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "official-seasons-presskit",
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "spring-p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "她的鹦鹉 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "harvey"
            },
            "label": "Harvey"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 也在房间里。随着环境中的异常逐渐出现，玩家开始意识到眼前不是一个连续的现实场景，而是一段可以被重新进入和重组的 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "memory"
            },
            "label": "记忆"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Her parrot "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "character",
              "id": "harvey"
            },
            "label": "Harvey"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " is also in the room. As the setting grows stranger, the scene starts to feel less like continuous reality and more like a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "memory"
            },
            "label": "memory"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " that can be revisited and rearranged."
          }
        ]
      },
      "spoiler": {
        "level": "minor",
        "requiredCompletedGameIds": [],
        "allowManualReveal": true
      },
      "provenance": {
        "mode": "editorial-summary",
        "sourceIds": [
          "primary-seasons-game",
          "editorial-rla"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "spring-p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "zhHans": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "本章最终以一个 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "黑色方块"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 和被整理完成的记忆画面收束。方块不是单纯的通关道具，它建立了 Seasons 最重要的叙事语法：通过 "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "memory-cube"
            },
            "label": "记忆方块"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " 在不同时间之间移动。"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "The chapter closes around a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "black-cube"
            },
            "label": "black cube"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and a reconstructed memory image. The cube is more than an exit device: it establishes Seasons’ central narrative grammar, moving among moments through "
          },
          {
            "kind": "entity",
            "entity": {
              "type": "concept",
              "id": "memory-cube"
            },
            "label": "memory cubes"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
